{
  "tema": 7430,
  "slug": "terminar-de-infinitivo",
  "titulo": "Terminar de + infinitive: to finish doing something",
  "subtitulo": "Termino de trabajar a las cinco: the end of an activity.",
  "foto": "t09.jpg",
  "regla": "Terminar (conjugated) + de + infinitive = to finish doing. Acabar de can mean this too, but more often means to have just done.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "To say _to finish doing_ something, the opposite of _to start doing_, use **terminar** (conjugated) + **de** + **infinitive**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "formula",
          "partes": [
            "**terminar**",
            "**de**",
            "infinitive"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Acabar de** is sometimes used with this meaning too, but **terminar de** is much more common."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Careful: **acabar de** + infinitive usually means _to have just done_ (**acabo de comer** = _I just ate_). See [[6508|acabar de]]."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Don't confuse it with **terminar** + gerund or **terminar por**, _to end up doing_ (see [[6597|acabar / terminar por]])."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **empezar a**, **terminar de**: the start and the finish line."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "Hoy ==termino de trabajar== un poco antes.",
              "en": "Today I finish work a bit earlier."
            },
            {
              "es": "Beto ==terminó de comer== a las cuatro y media.",
              "en": "Beto finished eating at four thirty."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Terminaremos de recoger== todo bastante tarde.",
              "en": "We'll finish cleaning up pretty late."
            },
            {
              "es": "Tengo que ==terminar de escribir== este párrafo.",
              "en": "I have to finish writing this paragraph."
            },
            {
              "es": "Cuando ==termines de rolar==, estírate.",
              "en": "When you finish rolling, stretch."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
